Dear Mr. Patrio,

Good day.

See below my response regarding your inquiry:


1. ) To provide you with a formal quotation please accomplish link below:

*Please send your request through this link
https://services.dost-ptri.com/pages/index.php
<https://services.dost-ptri.com/pages/index.php>. Under the "Choose a
Service" dropdown options, select TSD Lab Services then click Proceed*


2.) Please see attached guide on how to do the sampling for tensile
strength, single strand:


note po dapat dry sample nyo.



Tensile Strength (Single Strand)


 paki dikit ang c-template sa folder bago i cut isa isa, pag nadikit na sa
folder at na cut na dikitan ang isa isang c-template ng isang strand of
fiber (straight ang fiber pag dinikit).


Note: 35pcs  c-template gawin.



pero wag po masking tape gamitin nyo po kundi glue nalang kasi dumidikit po
sa machine ang masking tape.



3. Additionally, we would also like to specify our previous inquiry
regarding the textile product. We would like to know if it is possible to
create a piece of cloth or fabric (no specific size or dimensions required)
made out of the fibers to be produced.    - *to create a fabric or cloth
the fibers must process into yarns then yarn into fabric. With this you may
inquire it to our processing services you may contact them thru  8837-1157
and look for Sir Alexander Argame. *





Warm Regards,

Christy




You may contact us for further queries. Thank you for trusting DOST-PTRI
for your testing and analysis needs.

We are looking forward to our next transaction.

